#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Donations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "{% assign strings = site.data.strings.sidebars.donate %}"
msgstr "{% assign strings = site.data.strings.sidebars.donate %}"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "F-Droid is powered by your donations! Donate to keep free software thriving."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why your donation matters"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Everyday, people choose F-Droid to escape surveillance, ad trackers and proprietary control that dominates mainstream app stores. F-Droid represents more than an app store. It functions as a global system which protects user privacy, digital freedom and self-determination. Donations allow F-Droid to remain open source while ensuring security and operational independence."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Received donations are an integral part of F-Droid as they support in:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Server maintenance and support"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Administration, development and project maintenance"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Travel sponsorship for core contributors to organize, attend and host sessions at conferences, helping create an even bigger impact."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Outreach materials"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Donations are NOT used to financially support individual apps published on F-Droid. _To donate to app developers, use the donations options listed for each app._"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to donate"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "We recommend using donation platforms like [**Liberapay**](https://liberapay.com/F-Droid-Data/ \"https://liberapay.com/F-Droid-Data/\") or [**Open Collective**](https://opencollective.com/f-droid/ \"https://opencollective.com/f-droid/\"). These free software, community-driven donation platforms, support low-fee and transparent donations."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "You can support F-Droid via monthly recurring donations or with one-time gifts."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Monthly donations keep F-Droid sustainable. By setting up a recurring monthly donation, you create a dependable funding stream that helps us plan ahead, support development initiatives and maintain essential services without interruptions."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "The small gift of €5/month, when multiplied by thousands of supporters, results in a reliable funding stream for maintenance, innovation, security and outreach programs. Donors that support us on a recurring basis are key allies, helping us realize F-Droid's core mission - fighting for software freedom and privacy protection. Your recurring support empowers long term impact that one-time donations can't match."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Donation Tiers - The power of your support"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Your donation to F-Droid keeps free software thriving so we have established different tiers to demonstrate how your support benefits the project."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "F-Droid would achieve sustainability if all users donated $1/month."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "F-Droid Supporter ($12/year)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Plant the seed of digital freedom by supporting ongoing maintenance. Your support contributes to the expansion of the free software ecosystem."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "F-Droid Backer ($5/month)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Fuel the momentum behind free software. Your ongoing support strengthens the broader mission of F-Droid and helps us keep growing in ways that serves users and developers alike."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "F-Droid Sponsor ($100+/month)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Champion digital autonomy at a bigger scale. Your generosity provides meaningful capacity for us to advance F-Droid's long term resilience, reach and positive impact."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom Donations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "If your donation amount or frequency does not fit into one of the other categories, feel free to donate a custom amount once or multiple times per year. Your support helps sustain the project, its mission of user freedom and open, trustworthy software for everyone."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Institutional Support and Large Gifts"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Major gifts help turn community momentum into durable impact, supporting maintenance, security improvements, and the behind-the-scenes work that keeps the project stable. If your foundation or organization funds open-source sustainability, privacy, or public-interest tech, we are happy to discuss ways your support can make a lasting difference."
msgstr ""

